Add to init.d/rc.pvr:
### BEGIN INIT INFO
# Provides:          pvrsrvkm
# Required-Start:    $local_fs $remote_fs
# Required-Stop:     $local_fs $remote_fs
# Default-Start:     2 3 4 5
# Default-Stop:      0 1 6
# Short-Description: PowerVR SGX 530 Drivers
# Description:       Debian init script for PowerVR SGX 530 GPU drivers
### END INIT INFO

